{
  "displayName": "Medibox — Cost Monitoring",
  "mosaicLayout": {
    "columns": 12,
    "tiles": [
      {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Vertex AI Endpoint — GPU Duty Cycle (T4 cost driver)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/prediction/online/accelerator/duty_cycle\" resource.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/Endpoint\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MEAN",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MEAN"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "GPU duty cycle %"
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [{"value": 90, "color": "RED", "direction": "ABOVE", "label": "Alert threshold 90%"}],
            "yAxis": {"label": "%", "scale": "LINEAR"}
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 6,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Cloud Run — Billable Container Instance Hours",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/container/billable_instance_time\" resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\" resource.label.\"service_name\"=\"medibox-api\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "3600s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "plotType": "STACKED_BAR",
                "legendTemplate": "API instance-hours"
              },
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/container/billable_instance_time\" resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\" resource.label.\"service_name\"=\"medibox-worker\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "3600s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "plotType": "STACKED_BAR",
                "legendTemplate": "Worker instance-hours"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {"label": "instance-seconds", "scale": "LINEAR"}
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "yPos": 3,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "BigQuery — Bytes Scanned (controls query cost)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"bigquery.googleapis.com/storage/table_count\" resource.type=\"bigquery_project\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "3600s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MEAN",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "BQ tables"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {"label": "tables", "scale": "LINEAR"}
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 6,
        "yPos": 3,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "GCS — Storage Used (bytes)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"storage.googleapis.com/storage/total_bytes\" resource.type=\"gcs_bucket\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "3600s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MEAN",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                      "groupByFields": ["resource.label.bucket_name"]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "plotType": "STACKED_AREA",
                "legendTemplate": "${resource.label.bucket_name}"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {"label": "bytes", "scale": "LINEAR"}
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "yPos": 6,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Cloud Run API — Request Count (billing proxy)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/request_count\" resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "3600s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                      "groupByFields": ["resource.label.service_name"]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "plotType": "STACKED_BAR",
                "legendTemplate": "${resource.label.service_name}"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {"label": "requests/hr", "scale": "LINEAR"}
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 4,
        "yPos": 6,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Cloud SQL — DB size (bytes)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"cloudsql.googleapis.com/database/disk/bytes_used\" resource.type=\"cloudsql_database\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "3600s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MEAN",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MAX"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "DB disk bytes"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {"label": "bytes", "scale": "LINEAR"}
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 8,
        "yPos": 6,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Secret Manager — Access Count (auditing)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"secretmanager.googleapis.com/secret/access_count\" resource.type=\"secretmanager.googleapis.com/Secret\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "3600s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "plotType": "STACKED_BAR",
                "legendTemplate": "Secret accesses/hr"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {"label": "accesses", "scale": "LINEAR"}
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "yPos": 9,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 4,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Budget Alert — Monthly Spend Forecast (USD)",
          "text": {
            "content": "## Budget Thresholds\n\nSet via `gcloud billing budgets create`:\n\n| Threshold | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| $250 | Email alert (Vertex endpoint warming) |\n| $350 | Email alert (above baseline) |\n| $500 | Email + Pub/Sub → pause Vertex endpoint |\n\n**Idle baseline: ~$317/month** (10 pharmacies: ~$337, 100 pharmacies: ~$1,009)\n\nVertex AI T4 endpoint cannot scale to zero (DD-001): $252/month floor.\nRun `scripts/pause_endpoint.sh` to save ~$252/month when system is not in use.\n\n**Billing dashboard**: Cloud Console → Billing → Reports → filter by project.",
            "format": "MARKDOWN"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
